  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This artists' book is the result of a collaboration among participants at a workshop held at the Virginia Commonwealth University as part of a program "In Celebration of Book Art" which included faculty, professionals artists and students. Participants signed a list, from which each person received verbal information from the person whose name preceded his and visual information from the person whose name followed the information presented an element of random chance manipulation to be incorporated with other materials each artist had brought for use on his pages. This program 'In celebration of book art,' has been partially funded by a grant awarded by the Virginia Commission on the Arts."</subfield>
